'''Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering''' (月イベントオールスターズ スター大集合大感謝祭！, ''Tsuki Ibento Ōrusutāzu Sutā Dai Shūgō Dai Kanshasai ！'', '''Monthly Event All-Stars Star-Studded Thanksgiving!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] added in the [[Version 11.4 Update]]. Like all Gauntlets, progress made in Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet are many [[:Category:Event Enemies|Event Enemies]] that the player encounters during progress.

==Overview==
===About===
Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a stage includes XP. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

